  "rja3":[{"la":"Fi el-3chiya, *rja3* w ma l9ach el-mefte7.","en":"In the evening, he came back and didn't find the key.","lv":2},{"la":"El-wled dhe7kou w *rej3ou* lel-lo3ba.","en":"The boys laughed and went back to the game.","lv":3}],
